! Original OpenSwing verification geometry: a concentric stepped slender body.
! Radius jumps are weak limits of smooth transitions in the documented body law.
! This verifies source/force integration, not separated flow over blunt faces.
! With Cdf=Cdp=0 in uniform flow: zero net force, M_y=rho*Vol*V_x*V_z.
